{
  "slug": "prepkit-product",
  "name": "Prepkit Product",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Product management skills for Claude Code. Gives Claude structured methodologies for discovery synthesis (JTBD, empathy mapping, journey mapping), user research design    \n  (interview guides, screeners, synthesis plans), opportunity mapping (pursue/monitor/defer decisions), PRD authoring (evidence-linked requirements, Given/When/Then scenarios),\n   prioritization (RICE, MoSCoW, ICE scoring), metrics analysis (North Star, metric trees, HEART framework), engagement design (habit loops, gamification, PLG flows), and      \n  validation (evidence grading, cheapest-next-evidence routing). Each skill enforces evidence quality gates and chains into the next logical product step.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 command**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `product-discovery-synthesis` (Use for problem framing, JTBD synthesis, evidence-quality checks, and opportunity shaping during product discovery), `product-engagement-design` (Use for habit loops, progression systems, gamification mechanics, behavioral nudges, freemium funnel design, activation mechanics, and PLG conversion…), `product-facilitation` (Use when any product skill or workflow needs structured intake, shared product-context state, or a single authority for…), `product-metrics-analysis` (Use for outcome-based success metrics, baseline and target checks, leading indicators, and counter-metric validation across product work), `product-opportunity-mapping` (Use for turning discovery evidence into pursue, monitor, or defer opportunity decisions with dependencies and revisit triggers), `product-prd-authoring` (Use for evidence-linked requirements, explicit non-goals, Given/When/Then acceptance scenarios, and engineering-ready PRDs), `product-prioritization` (Use for scoring candidate slices once opportunity context, metric context, and tradeoff criteria are explicit), `product-user-interview-design` (Use for designing qualitative research packages: interview type, participant targeting, screener, guide, synthesis plan, and completion criteria), and 1 more\n- **Agents** (1): `product-strategy-reviewer` (Review product artifacts for evidence quality, opportunity fit, PRD rigor, prioritization discipline, and shared-state consistency)\n- **Commands** (1): `product-review-strategy` (Review product artifacts for evidence quality, routing fit, specification rigor, opportunity decisions, and prioritization discipline)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install prepkit-product@claude-community` from `namht1st/prepkit-product`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 9,
    "agent": 1,
    "command": 1
  },
